entry.summary:
I built a simple invoicing app for freelancers and small businesses — here's why. Most invoicing tools are bloated. You just want to create an invoice, send it, and get paid. Instead you get dashboards, analytics, integrations, and a $20/month subscription before you've even sent your first invoice. I built e-Invoice — a lightweight iOS app that does exactly what you need: Create and send polished PDF invoices in seconds Manage your client list with contact details Reusable line items for faster invoice creation Auto-calculated due dates (Net-15, 30, 45, 60 or custom) Sequential invoice numbering Share via email, Messages, or any app Sign in with Apple or email Cloud sync — data survives app deletion
